@startuml writeToDatabaseAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
writeToDatabaseAsync – Write / Update flow
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "writeToDatabaseAsync" as fo #LightCyan
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  writes/updates a value using an OAM path.
end note

requestor -> fo: (oamPath, value, isAList)
activate fo

note over fo
  <u>Steps</u>
  - Load JSON from config.json  
  - Parse OAM path  
  - Navigate to the target node  
  - If isAList → Append to list  
  - Else → Overwrite  
  - Save updated JSON
end note

fo -> cfg: load JSON
cfg --> fo: jsonData

fo -> cfg: save updated JSON
cfg --> fo: writeComplete

fo --> requestor: true (success)
deactivate fo

@enduml
